{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23147","headline":"西省北院新构小亭种竹开窗东通骑省与李常侍隔窗小饮各题四韵 · 白居易","name":"西省北院新构小亭种竹开窗东通骑省与李常侍隔窗小饮各题四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结托白须伴，因依青竹丛。\n题诗新壁上，过酒小窗中。\n深院晚无白，虚檐凉有风。\n金貂醉好看，回首紫垣东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}